WEBVTT

00:17.260 --> 00:18.730
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.620 --> 00:20.370
OH! The time has come

00:18.160 --> 00:18.730
BUSTERZ!

00:20.370 --> 00:23.760
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.720 --> 00:24.160
OH OH OH!

00:23.760 --> 00:26.320
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.320 --> 00:30.970
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:30.970 --> 00:34.340
Of history

00:34.340 --> 00:37.720
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:13.200 --> 01:17.020
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.630 --> 01:20.430
Presented by hwat fansubs

01:17.020 --> 01:18.570
The time has come

01:33.070 --> 01:37.290
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.660 --> 01:41.460
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.460 --> 01:48.380
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.380 --> 01:51.550
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.550 --> 01:56.640
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.640 --> 02:00.520
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.520 --> 02:04.770
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.770 --> 02:06.770
And then...

02:06.770 --> 02:10.530
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.530 --> 02:12.990
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.990 --> 02:18.120
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.120 --> 02:21.580
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.580 --> 02:27.500
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.500 --> 02:33.760
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.590 --> 02:39.640
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:47.650 --> 02:50.530
Close to the territory of the Toyotomi Shogunate,

02:50.530 --> 02:53.610
at the drooping pine of Ichijoji Temple in Kyoto.

03:00.540 --> 03:07.880
To avenge his brother, Yoshioka Denshichiro and his school did battle with a man.

03:08.250 --> 03:11.460
His name... was Miyamoto Musashi.

03:12.000 --> 03:16.300
Wielding two revolvers and proficient in the art of <i>gun-dou</i>,

03:16.300 --> 03:18.140
his strength lived up to the rumors.

03:20.350 --> 03:27.020
Meanwhile, ayakashi targeting Kaguya attacked Osaka Castle.

03:31.070 --> 03:33.990
The ones who saved Kaguya were Musashi,

03:33.990 --> 03:36.110
and me, a master of the sword.

03:57.880 --> 04:01.890
The powerful sorcery of the ayakashi leader, Yasha,

04:01.890 --> 04:04.270
forced us into a heated battle,

04:04.270 --> 04:08.770
but in the end, Musashi's gun-dou wounded him,

04:08.770 --> 04:12.610
and the battle ended in a draw.

04:12.230 --> 04:13.730
Gun-dou

04:14.780 --> 04:20.660
Kyoto

04:49.270 --> 04:50.690
This is it.

05:22.760 --> 05:23.970
Who are you?

05:23.970 --> 05:26.430
You knowingly enter Daitokuji Temple?

05:26.430 --> 05:28.060
Of course.

05:28.060 --> 05:30.640
Say, is there a master named Takuan here?

05:30.640 --> 05:33.270
Oh, sorry for my rudeness.

05:33.270 --> 05:35.820
You are an acquaintance of Master Takuan?

05:35.820 --> 05:37.440
Nope, don't know him.

05:37.440 --> 05:38.280
What?

05:38.280 --> 05:46.740
I happened to hear that Master Takuan was the first person to master gun-dou in Japan.

05:47.450 --> 05:50.290
I thought I'd try to get him to teach me a little.

05:50.290 --> 05:50.830
Wh- What insolence!

05:52.040 --> 05:54.750
This is no place for your ilk!

05:54.750 --> 05:56.630
Leave immediately!

05:58.500 --> 06:01.010
You... You know gun-dou?

06:01.010 --> 06:05.050
Come on, I'm just looking for a teacher. Yeah?

06:07.470 --> 06:09.560
Let me see Master Takuan.

06:09.680 --> 06:10.850
We will not!

06:21.740 --> 06:23.070
Settle down!

06:24.610 --> 06:26.740
Continue your training exercises.

06:29.910 --> 06:32.790
I apologize for my pupil's behavior.

06:32.790 --> 06:35.330
No worries. Hey, are you Takuan-san?

06:35.330 --> 06:38.250
Unfortunately, Master Takuan is currently not here.

06:38.250 --> 06:40.760
Could you come back another time?

06:40.760 --> 06:42.210
Eh? He's not here?

06:42.210 --> 06:43.760
When's he coming back?

06:44.300 --> 06:49.180
Well, I wonder. It could be tomorrow, or it could be in a year.

06:49.180 --> 06:51.810
So basically, you're telling me not to come back?

06:52.180 --> 06:55.650
Take my words as you will.

07:04.820 --> 07:07.320
Not here? You're lying, aren't you?

07:07.320 --> 07:10.370
I bet he's somewhere around here.

07:14.540 --> 07:17.830
I cannot allow you to take one step further in.

07:18.170 --> 07:22.210
See, he's here! You're bad at lying, mister.

07:22.710 --> 07:24.050
You...

07:24.050 --> 07:25.970
Hey, how about this?

07:25.970 --> 07:29.180
If I can beat you, let me see Master Takuan.

07:29.180 --> 07:30.930
How does that idea sound to you?

07:30.930 --> 07:33.390
I can see you are confident in your skills.

07:33.390 --> 07:36.230
Very well! I accept your proposition.

07:36.230 --> 07:38.100
Now we're talking!

08:04.420 --> 08:07.760
Ryougen-sama, I have returned.

08:08.300 --> 08:11.430
I believe I have told you not to address me by that name.

08:12.970 --> 08:15.730
My apologies for that.

08:16.810 --> 08:18.770
<i>Ryougen-sama</i>.

08:19.940 --> 08:24.110
Well, what of Kaguya? Where is the beautiful princess?

08:25.740 --> 08:32.160
You couldn't possibly have failed to retrieve Kaguya?

08:32.160 --> 08:36.500
Forgive me. There were obstacles.

08:36.830 --> 08:41.500
How unusual, especially for you.

08:41.830 --> 08:44.840
Who was it that stood in your way?

08:44.840 --> 08:49.550
A practitioner of gun-dou, in possession of <i>onmyoudan</i>.

08:49.880 --> 08:51.140
Gun-dou?

08:51.140 --> 08:52.800
Was it Sasaki Kojiro?

08:53.390 --> 08:57.680
No, it was a young one named Miyamoto Musashi.

08:57.680 --> 08:58.850
Musashi?

08:58.850 --> 09:00.520
Who is he?

09:00.520 --> 09:04.360
By all rights, he should be a user of a
two-sword style called <i>niten ichiryuu</i>,

09:04.360 --> 09:06.690
with which he has defeated
skilled swordsmen throughout Japan.

09:06.690 --> 09:09.860
A swordsman unparalleled, or so he would have been.

09:09.860 --> 09:14.580
In this world he is but an inconsequential bandit.

09:15.330 --> 09:18.540
And you lost to that bandit?

09:21.710 --> 09:24.340
Who is stronger between him and Kojiro?

09:24.340 --> 09:25.800
In this world,

09:26.420 --> 09:29.670
Kojiro is definitely superior.

09:29.670 --> 09:34.430
However, in the other world, on a
western island a few years from now,

09:34.430 --> 09:40.640
Miyamoto Musashi will make history as the one to defeat Sasaki Kojiro.

09:40.640 --> 09:41.600
Oh?

09:42.190 --> 09:44.150
Was my explanation satisfactory?

09:45.230 --> 09:48.230
Do not ask me the obvious!

09:49.490 --> 09:51.530
Understood.

09:52.070 --> 09:52.950
Yasha.

09:52.950 --> 09:53.780
Yes?

09:53.780 --> 09:56.080
In this "other world" you speak of,

09:56.080 --> 10:00.540
am I truly the one who will unite Japan?

10:00.540 --> 10:03.080
Of course.

10:03.080 --> 10:06.460
There, you won the battle at Sekigahara

10:06.460 --> 10:10.260
and established your shogunate at Edo.

10:10.260 --> 10:14.050
That is unmistakably the true history.

10:14.300 --> 10:16.010
True, you say?

10:16.350 --> 10:21.020
Then why do the Toyotomi rule in this world?

10:21.020 --> 10:24.150
Why have I not conquered all of Japan?

10:24.480 --> 10:28.940
From here, we shall return history to how it was.

10:28.940 --> 10:31.860
It is for that purpose that we, the ayakashi,

10:31.860 --> 10:37.410
are acting to grant your wish.

10:38.330 --> 10:40.080
I leave it in your hands, Yasha.

10:40.410 --> 10:44.170
If it is not done, I will have turned
my soul over to the ayakashi

10:44.170 --> 10:48.590
and been reduced to a monster for nothing!

10:48.590 --> 10:50.300
Ryougen-sama.

10:51.460 --> 10:52.760
What is it?

10:52.760 --> 10:56.090
The ayakashi are not monsters.

10:56.090 --> 11:01.890
We are the most beautiful, most powerful beings in the world.

11:01.890 --> 11:06.560
I urge you not to misunderstand.

11:15.990 --> 11:17.160
I have a question!

11:17.160 --> 11:18.620
What is it?

11:18.620 --> 11:20.450
From which school of gun-dou do you hail?

11:20.450 --> 11:23.410
School? Don't have one.

11:23.410 --> 11:24.870
You have no school?

11:25.210 --> 11:26.370
Yeah.

11:26.370 --> 11:29.000
If I have to answer, I guess I'd call it "me-school".

11:29.000 --> 11:30.750
Preposterous!

11:31.500 --> 11:33.960
That is fine. Let us begin!

11:38.260 --> 11:40.600
You do not know the etiquette of gun-dou?

11:40.970 --> 11:43.220
Etiquette? What does that have to do with anything?

11:43.220 --> 11:47.940
I cannot let one who does not even know the etiquette meet Takuan-sama!

11:47.940 --> 11:52.730
Huh? Didn't you say that you'd let me see him if I win?

11:52.730 --> 11:55.320
You have no school, and you are ignorant of ritual.

11:55.320 --> 11:57.450
There is no way I would lose to you!

11:58.990 --> 12:00.370
Begin!

12:02.740 --> 12:05.330
Guns in both left and right hands!

12:05.330 --> 12:07.120
He has two guns!

12:07.120 --> 12:10.460
Could he be the Miyamoto Musashi of the rumors?

12:10.460 --> 12:14.090
Oh, looks like I'm pretty famous.

12:14.090 --> 12:16.010
Oh, so you are?

12:16.010 --> 12:20.930
Then all the more, I cannot let you meet Takuan-sama!

12:20.930 --> 12:22.550
Why's that?

12:22.970 --> 12:27.430
You sneak into castles and work as a thief.

12:27.430 --> 12:30.770
Do you really think Takuan-sama would meet with a villain like you?

12:30.770 --> 12:33.520
Who knows, maybe he'll take a liking to me.

12:33.520 --> 12:34.530
I think not!

12:48.040 --> 12:50.870
Forged with the bone of ayakashi,

12:50.870 --> 12:52.670
Meiretsu seeks its own kind.

12:55.170 --> 12:58.380
Have they begun to move again?

12:58.380 --> 13:01.220
Sir, I leave my payment here.

13:07.350 --> 13:11.650
So the ayakashi have started to appear even in the city.

13:12.310 --> 13:14.360
Have the barriers weakened?

13:14.360 --> 13:17.530
Or are the ayakashi growing more powerful?

13:18.280 --> 13:21.740
In any case, it's going to get harder to live in the city.

13:28.790 --> 13:32.750
East! The temple Musashi was headed for is that way.

13:32.750 --> 13:33.630
I shall follow.

13:45.470 --> 13:49.220
That brat is better than we thought!

13:49.220 --> 13:52.690
But his opponent is our instructor, the third-strongest in our temple.

13:52.690 --> 13:54.190
There's no way he would lose.

13:59.530 --> 14:01.280
It's not over yet!

14:08.080 --> 14:10.200
It- It's my loss.

14:12.660 --> 14:15.130
The instructor lost?

14:15.130 --> 14:16.420
Unbelievable!

14:16.420 --> 14:17.880
Keep your promise.

14:17.880 --> 14:19.800
Let me see Master Takuan.

14:20.920 --> 14:24.010
Very well. But it's not possible right now.

14:24.260 --> 14:25.390
What?

14:25.390 --> 14:28.350
Takuan-sama really is not present here.

14:28.350 --> 14:31.350
If he returns, I will definitely arrange an audience for you.

14:31.350 --> 14:32.640
I promise.

14:32.640 --> 14:35.770
So please, I request you come back another day.

14:36.400 --> 14:38.730
Well, that sucks.

14:43.990 --> 14:44.910
What's this?

14:44.910 --> 14:46.820
This strange atmosphere!

14:46.820 --> 14:49.870
Is someone in this temple friends with an ayakashi?

14:49.870 --> 14:51.040
Or...

14:51.500 --> 14:53.660
maybe it's here to visit <i>me</i>.

14:57.040 --> 14:58.500
Ayakashi are coming!

14:58.500 --> 15:02.380
But Kyoto should be protected by the barrier!

15:52.310 --> 15:56.060
Mother! Could we take a look at that shop?

15:56.060 --> 16:00.230
No. They say that it sells strange, suspicious goods.

16:00.230 --> 16:03.820
It's famous, with all the rumors around it.

16:03.820 --> 16:06.070
Now, let's go.

16:17.080 --> 16:20.380
Mister Dabinoji, what's this?

16:20.380 --> 16:23.460
This? This is a <i>sensor</i>.

16:23.460 --> 16:25.920
Sensor? Is it related to <i>sensu</i> fans?

16:26.670 --> 16:29.130
Well, something like that.

16:30.010 --> 16:32.800
Can this actually make wind blow?

16:38.350 --> 16:39.810
It moved.

16:43.770 --> 16:46.070
Eighty to the northeast...

16:46.070 --> 16:49.030
Right around where old man Takuan is.

16:50.570 --> 16:52.160
What is it, Mister?

16:52.370 --> 16:54.830
Sorry, but the shop's closed for today.

17:01.040 --> 17:03.170
Go on and take these home with you.

17:07.010 --> 17:08.840
Sasuke, let's hurry.

17:33.910 --> 17:34.580
Wh- What is that huge shadow?

17:36.830 --> 17:39.790
Ayakashi! An ayakashi is flying this way!

17:48.840 --> 17:51.680
For an ayakashi to step upon the sacred ground of gun-dou,

17:51.680 --> 17:53.930
to enter our temple...

17:53.930 --> 17:55.430
Punishment!

18:07.770 --> 18:09.320
Air slashes...

18:10.610 --> 18:14.200
I am Jijoda. Come and fight!

18:14.450 --> 18:16.370
Prepare yourself, ayakashi!

18:16.370 --> 18:17.950
Monster!

18:18.950 --> 18:22.290
I told you, I am Jijoda, brat!

18:22.290 --> 18:24.210
Step back, young one!

18:24.210 --> 18:27.710
It looks like I'm his target.

18:28.300 --> 18:30.460
I'd feel bad if I got any of you hurt.

18:54.200 --> 18:58.580
Musashi, it seems that you're popular among the ayakashi.

18:58.580 --> 19:00.950
What, are they all women?

19:04.080 --> 19:06.040
I'll deal with all of these.

19:06.040 --> 19:09.130
You go after that flying monster.

19:09.130 --> 19:10.590
Thanks.

19:10.590 --> 19:12.090
Sorry for the trouble, Ronin.

19:18.010 --> 19:20.430
The interference is back again...

19:20.430 --> 19:22.600
Musashi-dono's faithful underling!

19:22.600 --> 19:24.310
Ninja among ninjas,

19:24.310 --> 19:27.150
Ninjataro at your service!

19:27.150 --> 19:30.610
Ninjagoro, today's no walk in the park.

19:30.860 --> 19:33.360
My name is Ninja<i>taro</i>!

19:38.660 --> 19:40.780
Not that I really care,

19:40.780 --> 19:45.210
but you really should know the limits of your skill, Ninjashiro.

19:45.410 --> 19:47.040
It's <i>-taro</i>!

20:23.580 --> 20:24.160
He- He's so strong!

20:25.290 --> 20:27.910
So this is what he's been fighting all along...

21:31.350 --> 21:33.480
He's going to crash into the temple?

21:34.360 --> 21:36.860
Watch out! You there, move!

21:38.070 --> 21:41.240
Holy crap! He must have hearing problems!

21:44.030 --> 21:45.030
Run!

21:46.280 --> 21:49.200
Man, I worry about you. Fine, then!

21:49.200 --> 21:51.250
Just don't move a step from here!

21:51.250 --> 21:53.210
Prepare yourself, monster!

21:53.420 --> 21:55.040
Take this! <i>Onmyoudan</i>!

21:57.420 --> 21:59.010
Whoa, so bright!

21:59.010 --> 22:00.510
Musashi, run away!

22:00.840 --> 22:02.180
Musashi!

22:02.720 --> 22:05.550
Don't need to tell me twice.

22:05.550 --> 22:06.510
Come on, old man.

22:07.640 --> 22:08.970
What are you doing?

22:09.390 --> 22:10.770
This is a nice gun.

22:11.270 --> 22:12.850
I'll be borrowing these.

22:29.330 --> 22:31.870
That old man is amazing.

22:31.870 --> 22:34.080
He's fighting while falling.

22:59.860 --> 23:01.690
Old man... You...

23:05.030 --> 23:08.120
Are you Master Takuan?

23:08.780 --> 23:10.740
Takuan is gone, isn't he?

23:11.160 --> 23:12.370
But—

23:22.510 --> 23:24.550
I like the look in your eyes.

23:27.590 --> 23:30.180
Master Takuan, teach me your gun-dou!

23:30.180 --> 23:31.100
I beg you!

23:31.510 --> 23:33.770
I want to become stronger!

23:33.770 --> 23:37.150
Strongest in Japan, no, the world!

23:39.360 --> 23:40.610
Please!

23:41.520 --> 23:43.230
Master Takuan!

24:00.630 --> 24:03.380
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.380 --> 24:06.220
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:06.220 --> 24:11.550
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.550 --> 24:16.730
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:18.230 --> 24:23.360
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:23.360 --> 24:29.530
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.530 --> 24:34.870
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.870 --> 24:39.000
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.380 --> 24:51.760
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.760 --> 25:02.690
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.690 --> 25:05.440
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.440 --> 25:08.320
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:08.320 --> 25:13.910
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.910 --> 25:16.660
I'll bring out every part

25:16.660 --> 25:19.660
of your unchanging style

25:19.660 --> 25:24.960
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.960 --> 25:30.130
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:31.050 --> 25:32.720
Hey, Takuan!

25:32.720 --> 25:35.600
Come on, teach me gun-dou!

25:35.600 --> 25:36.930
Geez!

25:36.930 --> 25:40.600
That woman's trying to kill me again!

25:40.600 --> 25:47.230
The next chapter: <i>Master Takuan</i>!
